<title>USA: Possis Medical coronary graft approved.</title>
<headline>Possis Medical coronary graft approved.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Possis Medical Inc said Wednesday it has received the CE Mark approval for its Perma-Flow Coronary Bypass Graft.</p>
<p>The CE Mark allows the Perma-Flow Graft to be sold throughout the European Union.</p>
<p>The Perma-Flow Graft is a synthetic blood vessel designed for use in coronary artery bypass surgery.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
